  "releaseNotes": "- ImageEditor: exports keep the resolution, aspect ratio, format and transparency of the selection instead of being resized to 170 x 170.\n\t\t\t- ImageEditor: flips and crops are encoded once, gestures no longer round-trip to .NET per frame and images move without base64.\n\t\t\t- ImageEditor: fixed the crop overlay misalignment and added MaxOutputDimension, OutputFormat and OutputQuality.\n\t\t\t- Fixed connected-list drag and drop, selected-value overflow and trailing form icon spacing.",
